00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:55.540
TECHNIQUE

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:58.040
Mama! Hurry! Hurry!

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.170
Look, Wolfie girl!

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:04.050
<b>Secret Society: Agastia Great Leader
Akashic</b>

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:04.320
So many shops!

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:05.930
Just a moment, Great Leader!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:09.790
We've gotta make a plan of 
action for these things!

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:13.050
No running, you two!

00:13:13.050 --> 00:13:17.160
I feel like I'm escorting 
little cousins or something.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.060
A routine inspection?

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:20.990
Yes.

00:13:20.990 --> 00:13:23.600
Maintenance for the monsters who 
work at the amusement park

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:25.660
run by Agastia's front company.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:28.980
Would you mind doing it 
for us, Miss Kuroitsu?

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:30.270
Sure thing.

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:32.820
I'd like to see how Cannon 
and Hydra are doing, anyway.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:35.210
You can leave when you're done.

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:37.390
Or you can hang out a while first.

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:40.490
I think I'm a little old for amusement parks.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:44.320
And it would be a little awkward 
playing around on my own.

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:51.080
I mean, we really didn't 
come here to play around.

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:49.910
It's perfect on you, Great Leader!

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:51.080
I know, right?

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:55.210
We know! Great Leader and I are here 
to inspect the amusement park!

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:58.310
Yes! We need to make sure the 
attractions are running right!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:13:59.850
It's important work!

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:01.650
Yes, I suppose.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:04.620
But remember, you can't put 
purchases on the company tab.

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:06.220
Okay!

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:17.970
This rocks!

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:21.210
There are still lots more 
checks to do, Wolfie girl!

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:23.270
Oh, right... Great Leader...

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:26.200
I'd really like you to treat me as a man.

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:28.140
I'm not really fond of the "Wolfie girl" thing.

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:32.700
But you're kind of a girl and a boy...

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:34.150
Wolfie boygirl?

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:37.420
"Girl" is fine.

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:39.790
Have fun!

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.640
Thanks, big birdie!

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:44.390
Are you feeling all right, Cannon?

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:46.460
Yes, all is well!

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:47.900
<b>Long-Range Attack Specialized Monster
Cannon Thunderbird</b>

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:48.150
I'm in fine feather today!

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:50.650
What else would you expect... from a bird?!

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:53.250
Gross. Did you really just 
tell a lame-ass dad joke?

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:55.370
<b>Re-Regenerated • Regenerating Monster
New • Hydra</b>

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:56.380
All is well? It's the opposite of well!

00:14:56.380 --> 00:15:01.180
Indeed! What kind of louse spends all his 
time with someone, but never holds her hand?

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:04.560
Only a real asshole refuses 
to make a move after getting

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:06.640
a handmade lunch and hand-baked cookies!

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:08.440
Look at this gutless piece of crap!

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:11.570
But Cannon's just so innocent.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.650
I guess all's well here, huh?

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:17.650
Look, Wolfie girl!

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:20.160
Aren't those fancy balloons just the cutest?

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.900
<b>Remaining Today: 1</b>

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.890
And it's the last one they've got.

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:23.590
Let's buy it.

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:25.420
All right! Let's go!

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.400
<b>Remaining Today: 1</b>

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:28.400
I'll take that one.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:32.140
Mommy! Mommy! Buy me a balloon!

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:35.170
I can't, dear. She's getting the last one.

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.970
But... I want a balloon...

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:43.920
Great Leader, should I...

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:45.720
Ignore her.

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:48.680
Buy it at once, Wolfie girl.

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:48.500
There's nothing we can do.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:49.170
But...

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:54.430
Limited resources should go to the powerful

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:56.930
who can use them to their fullest potential.

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:59.970
This is the principle behind our conquest.

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.350
Thank you!

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:12.940
Thanks for the balloon!

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:15.830
Can't say no to a little 
kid, huh, Great Leader?

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:18.180
I grew tired of it once I had it in my grasp.

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:24.200
Well, I've had the gallstones forever,

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:26.250
<b>Aquatic Monster
Sahuagin</b>

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:26.970
but lately I've gotten an ulcer, too.

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:29.830
Your physical specs seem fine,

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:32.970
but I'm sorry to hear you haven't 
been feeling well, Sahuagin.

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:38.410
My job at this attraction is to leap from 
the water and pretend to attack people.

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:42.180
But a little while ago, 
I made eye contact with a kid,

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.080
and she started bawling her eyes out.

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:45.000
It's okay! It's okay!

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:45.140
Oh, dear...

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:47.270
That might be a little scary for a kid.

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:52.120
I've tried to avoid eye contact 
as much as I can since then,

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:53.890
but it's got me a little depressed.

00:16:53.890 --> 00:16:58.820
You might need psychosomatic treatment 
more than you need maintenance.

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:01.910
Great Leader! I got 'em!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:06.540
Huh? She still in the bathroom or something?

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.660
Eh?

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.980
Watch where you're going, you little brat!

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:14.170
You made me drop my 
limited-edition mint caramel!

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:17.210
Well? What've you got to say for yourself?

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:26.600
Here.

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.070
Thanks, miss!

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.080
"Mister," if you please!

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:36.750
Hey, you little bitch!

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:39.440
You don't use a grown man 
as a stepping stone!

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:43.130
Yeah, you're a real "grown man,"
 bullying a little kid.

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:45.200
You're a real piece of work.

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:47.710
Hang on. Are you a monster?

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:51.200
I was told not to attack humans,

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:53.540
but I can attack monsters no problem!

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:57.720
<b>Secret Society: Black Lore
Monster  White Alligator</b>

00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:58.640
<i>A monster?</i>

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:00.380
<i>But not from Agastia...</i>

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:01.470
<i>From a different organization!</i>

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:06.730
I am the mighty White Alligator 
from Secret Society: Black Lore!

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:09.210
I'll bring you to your knees!

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.870
What a slowpoke!

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:19.010
C-Curse you...

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:27.760
That's a dirty little trick...

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:30.880
You pathetic little wolf-girl!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:33.740
A real monster does 
whatever it takes to win!

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:35.750
Put the girl down, man!

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:40.630
Feel free to fight back... if you 
don't care what happens to her!

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:46.140
I'll fill you full of holes, 
like a chocolate crunch!

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:51.380
Look at you now!

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:53.580
I'll tear the flesh from your bones!

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:54.410
Excuse me.

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:57.090
What do you want?

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:59.040
One, two...

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:09.530
Great Leader!

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:11.780
You okay, Wolfie girl?

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:13.980
Boy, you sure saved my butt!

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.800
You really are the strongest in Agastia!

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:19.800
Just glad it's all okay!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.560
This is <i>not</i> okay!

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:23.300
I've gotta regenerate him at once!

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:25.550
This is gonna be a serious 
interorganizational issue.

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:28.550
Is this enough parts to fix him?

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:33.820
Wolfie, can't you remember 
how he used to look?

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:38.310
Was it two alligators... or three?

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:40.600
Who cares how many there were?

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:42.780
Who's gonna say no to extra alligators?

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:45.590
It's more fun to have a big family!

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:47.050
No!

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:49.770
We have to get him back to 
normal and hide what happened,

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:52.330
or we'll have an interorganizational 
conflict on our hands!

00:19:56.920 --> 00:20:00.180
It's all their fault anyway!

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:17.770
<b>Incoming Call</b>

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:20.860
<b>Matsuyama - Danger</b>

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:29.240
<b>Are you free tomorrow, Miss Mizuki?</b>

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.780
"Are you free tomorrow, Miss Mizuki?"

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:32.440
Well, I am... but not for you.

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:35.970
"We've got a pretty good gig coming up."

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:38.250
It's definitely going to be awful.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:44.430
<b>This one's close by. In Tokyo. No van commute required.</b>

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:42.290
"This one's close by. In Tokyo. 
No van commute required."

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:44.600
No way. Not falling for that one again!

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:49.310
<b>Liability and health insurance both provided</b>

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:46.930
"Liability and health 
insurance both provided!"

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:49.590
I don't care! I don't like these jobs!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:52.520
<b>Great pay, and totally under the table...</b>

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:52.510
"Great pay, and totally under the table!"

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:55.370
She's talking about tax evasion! No way!

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:59.480
"I sure would love to have you, Miss Mizuki! 
It's such a sausage fest over here..."

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:02.520
I mean, it's pretty weird that you're 
doing it at all, Miss Matsuyama.

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:05.100
"I don't have any other friends."

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:07.780
I don't have any either, but...

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:12.290
<b>I was so glad to meet you in Tokyo that first time</b>

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:12.280
"I was so glad to meet you 
in Tokyo that first time."

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:14.780
What in the world...

00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:19.480
"It's really rough work, 
but I like doing it with you."

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:20.890
Hey, come on...

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:24.050
<b>Tofu</b>

00:21:21.310 --> 00:21:24.080
"I sure hope you're free tomorrow..."

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:26.090
"I want to see you..."

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:27.510
"Let's meet up..."

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.300
Thriving Business...

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:34.370
Edoranger!

