00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:56.640
<b>These heroes are 
not a work of fiction!
They really exist!</b>

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:07.350
Abundant Hospitality!

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:12.200
All right! We'll crush you now!

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:14.360
Closing up shop!

00:23:13.710 --> 00:23:18.810
Shutter! Shutter!

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:15.630
Now...

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:18.370
<b>Dead Broke</b>

